## City maps: ODbL (OpenStreetMap)

The city files in `public/cities/` are built from OpenStreetMap data by
`scripts/build-city.ts`. They are © OpenStreetMap contributors and available
under the Open Database License (ODbL): https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/

If you share a modified version of these files, you must share it under the
ODbL too. The game shows "© OpenStreetMap contributors" on the map.

The base map is served by OpenFreeMap (https://openfreemap.org), using
OpenMapTiles and OpenStreetMap data, and is credited on the map as well.

